# Version 1 requires no environment variables or secrets.
#
# The two D1 databases are wired via bindings in wrangler.jsonc
# (JOB_TRACKER_DB, HEALTH_MONITOR_DB), not environment variables.
#
# Authentication secrets (JWT_SECRET, GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID, GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET)
# become relevant starting in Version 2 — see docs/plans/v2-plan.md.
